A note on what this software does
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The LiberaQT agent is loaded into another application's process and exposes its
object tree over a loopback socket. It is inert unless LIBERAQT_TOKEN is set,
listens only on 127.0.0.1, requires that token, and accepts one client. It is
nonetheless a remote code execution surface by design and must never be shipped
in a production build.

